                                "sense_id": "4cf87478-8143-3362-892f-ee913ff4f42f",
                                "text": "[T]hat assertion of the wise man: 'Labor not for riches; wilt thou set thy heart on that which is not?' it, well applied, will pluck down the high places reared to this great idol of clay in men's hearts: will confute the common conceits and phrases which so beatify wealth; […]"
